        </svg>

        <Foto id="abeja-mano" src="/pitch/abeja-mano.jpg" ancho={780} alto={351} retraso={0.3} clase="f-abeja" />

        <ul class="idea">
          <li><span class="idea-k">Todo nace de la misma idea:</span> trabajar con lo que la naturaleza ya da</li>
          <li>Pistachos en secano, sin riego</li>
          <li>Casas de barro con materiales que otros descartan</li>
          <li>Abejas que enseñan</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ 4 · DIFERENCIAL ============ -->
      <section class="diapo" data-en="4">
        <h2 class="titulo">Todas suman, pero son momentos aislados</h2>

        <ul class="aislados">
          <li><span class="punto"></span>Clase en el aula</li>
          <li><span class="punto"></span>Charla puntual</li>
          <li><span class="punto"></span>Salida al campo</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="etiqueta-gris">hoy</p>

        <svg class="ciclo" viewBox="0 0 1920 1080" aria-hidden="true">
          <path class="flecha-gris trazo-anim" filter="url(#ink)" d="M840 600 C900 590 940 590 990 600 M970 585 l22 15 l-22 15" />
          <circle class="anillo trazo-anim" cx="1360" cy="600" r="290" filter="url(#ink)" />
          <path class="punta" d="M1360 310 l-22 -14 M1360 310 l-22 14" filter="url(#ink)" />
          <path class="punta" d="M1360 890 l22 -14 M1360 890 l22 14" filter="url(#ink)" />
          <g class="nodo nodo-1"><ellipse cx="1070" cy="600" rx="112" ry="62" fill="url(#pg-cielo)" filter="url(#wc-soft)" /><text x="1070" y="612" class="nodo-t">Escuela</text></g>
          <g class="nodo nodo-2"><ellipse cx="1650" cy="600" rx="112" ry="62" fill="url(#pg-pistacho-light)" filter="url(#wc-soft)" /><text x="1650" y="612" class="nodo-t">Chacra</text></g>
        </svg>
        <Foto id="panal" src="/pitch/panal-manos.jpg" ancho={380} alto={380} retraso={0.8} clase="f-panal" />
        <p class="continuo"><strong>Un programa continuo</strong><br />en una chacra real</p>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ 5 · ESTADO ACTUAL ============ -->
      <section class="diapo" data-en="5">
        <h2 class="titulo">El método está probado. La chacra, en marcha.</h2>

        <div class="cifras">
          <div class="cifra"><p class="cifra-n"><span id="contador">+3.000</span></p><p class="cifra-t">alumnos en Alemania</p></div>
          <div class="cifra"><p class="cifra-n">2</p><p class="cifra-t">escuelas piloto en Uruguay</p></div>
          <div class="cifra"><p class="cifra-n">1ª</p><p class="cifra-t">plantación orgánica de pistachos del Uruguay</p></div>
        </div>

        <Foto id="colmena" src="/pitch/colmena-ninos.jpg" ancho={620} alto={290} retraso={0.5} clase="f-colmena" />
        <Foto id="casa" src="/pitch/casa-barro.jpg" ancho={300} alto={430} retraso={0.75} clase="f-casa" />
        <Foto id="plantacion" src="/pitch/plantacion.jpg" ancho={300} alto={430} retraso={1} clase="f-plantacion" />

        <p class="falta"><span>Lo que falta:</span> precio · formato · canal de venta</p>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ 6 · EQUIPO ============ -->
      <section class="diapo" data-en="6">
        <h2 class="titulo">¿Por qué nosotros?</h2>

        <div class="equipo">
          <p class="persona">Catalina</p>
          <p class="rol">docente · apicultora · pedagoga apícola certificada</p>
          <p class="gen"><strong>4 generaciones</strong></p>
          <ul class="familia">
            <li><strong>Stefan</strong> — casas de barro</li>
            <li><strong>Maxi</strong> — digital</li>
            <li><strong>Jasmin</strong> — diseño</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="red">+ vecinos, apicultores y productores de la zona</p>
        </div>

        <Foto id="catalina" src="/pitch/catalina.jpg" ancho={560} alto={420} encuadre={{ x: -540, y: -130, w: 1100, h: 619 }} retraso={0.3} clase="f-catalina" />
        <Foto id="grupo" src="/pitch/grupo.jpg" ancho={560} alto={420} retraso={0.7} clase="f-grupo" />
      </section>

      <!-- ============ 7 · CIERRE ============ -->
      <section class="diapo" data-en="7">
        <h2 class="titulo"><span class="tachado">gratuito</span> → listo para el mercado</h2>

        <p class="meta-n">10–15</p>
        <p class="meta-t">colegios privados de Maldonado<br />reservan un módulo</p>
        <ul class="chips">
          <li>precio y formato validados</li>
          <li>registro de marca iniciado</li>
        </ul>

        <svg class="sello" viewBox="0 0 360 360" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="180" cy="180" r="150" fill="url(#pg-miel)" filter="url(#wc-wash)" />
          <text x="180" y="170" class="sello-n">2 meses</text>
          <text x="180" y="218" class="sello-t">con la CIE</text>
        </svg>

        <Foto id="vela" src="/pitch/vela.jpg" ancho={340} alto={460} retraso={0.6} clase="f-vela" />
      </section>

      <!-- ============ 8 · FINAL ============ -->
      <section class="diapo" data-en="8">
        <svg class="arbol" viewBox="0 0 1920 1080" aria-hidden="true">
          <path class="trazo" filter="url(#ink)" d="M440 905 C560 895 700 912 960 900" />
          <path class="tronco" filter="url(#ink)" d="M640 902 C632 800 646 700 634 560 M636 720 C590 660 540 620 480 590 M638 650 C690 600 740 560 800 530 M636 600 C620 500 600 420 570 330 M640 560 C680 470 700 380 730 300" />
          <g class="copa" filter="url(#wc-wash)">
            <ellipse class="hoja-c" cx="640" cy="420" rx="230" ry="190" fill="url(#pg-pistacho-light)" opacity="0.7" />
            <ellipse class="hoja-c" cx="500" cy="500" rx="150" ry="120" fill="url(#pg-pistacho)" opacity="0.55" />
            <ellipse class="hoja-c" cx="790" cy="490" rx="160" ry="125" fill="url(#pg-pistacho)" opacity="0.5" />
            <ellipse class="hoja-c" cx="560" cy="300" rx="140" ry="110" fill="url(#pg-pistacho-light)" opacity="0.75" />
            <ellipse class="hoja-c" cx="740" cy="290" rx="130" ry="105" fill="url(#pg-pistacho)" opacity="0.45" />
            <ellipse class="hoja-c" cx="650" cy="210" rx="110" ry="85" fill="url(#pg-pistacho-light)" opacity="0.7" />
            <ellipse class="hoja-c" cx="430" cy="400" rx="100" ry="85" fill="url(#pg-pistacho-light)" opacity="0.6" />
            <ellipse class="hoja-c" cx="860" cy="380" rx="95" ry="80" fill="url(#pg-pistacho-light)" opacity="0.6" />
            <ellipse class="hoja-c" cx="640" cy="560" rx="170" ry="90" fill="url(#pg-pistacho)" opacity="0.4" />
          </g>
          <g class="flores" filter="url(#wc-soft)">
            <ellipse class="flor" cx="520" cy="360" rx="22" ry="18" fill="url(#pg-miel)" />
            <ellipse class="flor" cx="760" cy="420" rx="20" ry="16" fill="url(#pg-miel)" />
            <ellipse class="flor" cx="650" cy="300" rx="18" ry="15" fill="url(#pg-miel)" />
            <ellipse class="flor" cx="590" cy="520" rx="20" ry="16" fill="url(#pg-miel)" />
            <ellipse class="flor" cx="820" cy="300" rx="16" ry="13" fill="url(#pg-miel)" />
            <ellipse class="flor" cx="470" cy="470" rx="15" ry="12" fill="url(#pg-miel)" />
          </g>
        </svg>

        <blockquote class="cita">
          Donde algunos ven una tierra agotada,<br /><em>nosotros vemos un aula.</em>
        </blockquote>
        <p class="firma">Retoños del Edén</p>
        <p class="lema">donde el tiempo se vuelve raíz</p>
        <Foto id="cartel" src="/pitch/cartel.jpg" ancho={460} alto={330} retraso={1.4} clase="f-cartel" />
        <p class="web">retoniosdeleden.com</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Fortschritt: Ranke, die mit jedem Schritt wächst (rechts, weg von der Kamera) -->
      <svg class="progreso" viewBox="0 0 1920 1080" aria-hidden="true">
        <path id="rama" class="rama" filter="url(#ink)" d="M480 1040 C640 1010 760 1060 920 1035 S1200 1010 1360 1036 S1640 1050 1820 1020" />
        <g class="hojas" id="hojas"></g>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<script>
  const PASOS = 8;
  const escenario = document.getElementById('escenario') as HTMLElement;
  const sala = document.getElementById('sala') as HTMLElement;
  const diapos = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.diapo'));
  const rama = document.getElementById('rama') as unknown as SVGPathElement;
  const hojas = document.getElementById('hojas') as unknown as SVGGElement;
  const vuelo = document.getElementById('vuelo-abeja') as unknown as SVGAnimationElement | null;
  const contador = document.getElementById('contador') as HTMLElement;
  let paso = 0;

  // Bühne auf das Fenster einpassen
  function ajustar() {
    const s = Math.min(window.innerWidth / 1920, window.innerHeight / 1080);
    escenario.style.setProperty('--escala', String(s));
  }
  window.addEventListener('resize', ajustar);
  ajustar();

  // Ranke vorbereiten: Länge messen, Blätter entlang des Pfads verteilen
  const largo = rama.getTotalLength();
  rama.style.setProperty('--largo', String(largo));
  const ns = 'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';
  for (let i = 1; i <= PASOS; i++) {
    const p = rama.getPointAtLength((largo * i) / PASOS - 6);
    const hoja = document.createElementNS(ns, 'ellipse');
    hoja.setAttribute('cx', String(p.x));
    hoja.setAttribute('cy', String(p.y - 14));
    hoja.setAttribute('rx', '15');
    hoja.setAttribute('ry', '7');
    hoja.setAttribute('transform', `rotate(${i % 2 ? -35 : 35} ${p.x} ${p.y - 14})`);
    hoja.setAttribute('class', 'hoja');
    hoja.dataset.n = String(i);
    hojas.appendChild(hoja);
  }

  function contar() {
    const fin = 3000;
    const t0 = performance.now();
    const dur = 1600;
    function cuadro(t: number) {
      const k = Math.min(1, (t - t0) / dur);
      const v = Math.round(fin * (1 - Math.pow(1 - k, 3)));
      contador.textContent = '+' + v.toLocaleString('es-UY');
      if (k < 1 && paso === 5) requestAnimationFrame(cuadro);
    }
    requestAnimationFrame(cuadro);
  }

  function ir(n: number) {
    paso = Math.max(0, Math.min(PASOS, n));
    escenario.dataset.paso = String(paso);
    for (const d of diapos) {
      const en = (d.dataset.en || '').split(',').map(Number);
      d.classList.toggle('activa', en.includes(paso));
    }
    rama.style.setProperty('--avance', String(paso / PASOS));
    hojas.querySelectorAll<SVGElement>('.hoja').forEach((h) => {
      h.classList.toggle('visible', Number(h.dataset.n) <= paso);
    });
    if (paso === 3 && vuelo) vuelo.beginElement();
    if (paso === 5) contar();
  }

  function siguiente() { ir(paso + 1); }
  function anterior() { ir(paso - 1); }

  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (['ArrowRight', ' ', 'PageDown', 'Enter'].includes(e.key)) { e.preventDefault(); siguiente(); }
    else if (['ArrowLeft', 'PageUp', 'Backspace'].includes(e.key)) { e.preventDefault(); anterior(); }
    else if (e.key === 'Home') ir(0);
    else if (e.key === 'f' || e.key === 'F') {
      if (document.fullscreenElement) document.exitFullscreen();
      else document.documentElement.requestFullscreen();
    }
  });
  sala.addEventListener('click', siguiente);

  // Mauszeiger ausblenden, wenn er ruht
  let reposo = 0;
  document.addEventListener('mousemove', () => {
    document.body.classList.remove('sin-cursor');
    clearTimeout(reposo);
    reposo = window.setTimeout(() => document.body.classList.add('sin-cursor'), 1500);
  });

  // Alle Fotos vorab dekodieren, damit während der Aufnahme nichts nachlädt
  const fuentes = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('image')).map((i) => i.getAttribute('href') || '');
  Promise.all(fuentes.map((src) => { const im = new Image(); im.src = src; return im.decode().catch(() => {}); }))
    .then(() => escenario.classList.add('listo'));

  ir(0);
</script>

<style>
  :global(html),
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--papel);
  }
  :global(body.sin-cursor),
  :global(body.sin-cursor *) {
    cursor: none !important;
  }

  .sala {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--papel);
  }

  .escenario {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    width: 1920px;
    height: 1080px;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(var(--escala, 1));
    transform-origin: center;
    background: var(--papel);
    color: var(--tinta);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .fondo,
  .escena,
  .panal,
  .ciclo,
  .arbol,
  .progreso {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 1920px;
    height: 1080px;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ---------- Folien ---------- */
  .diapo {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transform: scale(1.015);
    filter: blur(6px);
    transition:
      opacity 0.7s var(--ease-out),
      transform 0.9s var(--ease-out),
      filter 0.7s var(--ease-out),
      visibility 0s linear 0.7s;
  }
  .diapo.activa {
    opacity: 1;
    visibility: visible;
    transform: none;
    filter: none;
    transition:
      opacity 0.9s var(--ease-out) 0.15s,
      transform 1.2s var(--ease-out) 0.15s,
      filter 0.9s var(--ease-out) 0.15s,
      visibility 0s;
  }

  .titulo {
    position: absolute;
    left: 120px;
    top: 96px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 68px;
    line-height: var(--lh-tight);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--tinta);
  }
  .antetitulo {
    position: absolute;
    left: 122px;
    top: 58px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--miel-800);
  }

  /* Gemeinsame Zeichen-Animation für Tuschelinien */
  .trazo,
  .trazo-anim {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--tinta-suave);
    stroke-width: 3.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 1400;
    stroke-dashoffset: 1400;
  }
  .activa .trazo,
  .activa .trazo-anim {
    animation: dibujar 1.4s var(--ease-out) forwards;
  }
  @keyframes dibujar {
    to { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
  }

  /* ---------- 1 · Problema ---------- */
  .t-pregunta {
    max-width: 720px;
    top: 110px;
    transition: opacity 0.8s var(--ease-out), transform 0.8s var(--ease-out);
  }
  .chirca {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--tinta-tenue);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .activa .chirca { animation: aparecer 0.8s var(--ease-out) 0.9s forwards; }

  .estaca {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--tinta);
    stroke-width: 11;
